{
  "about": "The iPad's own rules of the playback model (v0.6.3, #608 item 3, the lead's decision reversing #521 5 on the iPad): while Цикл plays, a selection that appears or changes so that it does not hold the position takes playback to its start and loops it; one that holds it plays on; stopped, as the shared file has it. PlaybackPositionTests runs these in place of the shared cases named in 'replaces' (Golden/playback-model.json, which the web's reference runs unchanged).",
  "replaces": [
    "changes with Цикл on: the new one loops, the position stays and is caught when playback reaches it",
    "changes away from the position with Цикл on: the position does not jump",
    "changes to behind the position while playing: the loop cannot catch it, so Цикл turns off (#521 5)",
    "appears while playing before it: Цикл on, the loop waits, the position stays",
    "appears while playing behind the position: Цикл stays off, nothing loops (#521 5)"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "rule": "T10",
      "name": "changes ahead of the position while Цикл plays: playback goes to its start and loops it",
      "given": {
        "selection": {
          "start": 960,
          "end": 1920
        },
        "loop": true,
        "tick": 480,
        "transport": "playing"
      },
      "event": {
        "type": "select",
        "selection": {
          "start": 1920,
          "end": 2880
        }
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "loop",
          "start": 1920,
          "end": 2880
        },
        {
          "type": "seek",
          "at": 1920
        }
      ],
      "then": {
        "selection": {
          "start": 1920,
          "end": 2880
        },
        "loop": true,
        "tick": 1920,
        "transport": "playing"
      },
      "view": {
        "inside": true,
        "black": 1920,
        "blue": 1920,
        "playing": true,
        "context": "selection",
        "at": 1920
      }
    },
    {
      "rule": "T10",
